// HOL Light: Multivariate/measure.ml:2050 / MEASURE_FRONTIER
// Source hash: md5:5f5090a63f2454789758103c37aec6f8
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_cart_setexp, hol_real_R)
Theorem MEASURE_FRONTIER : forall N:set, N <> Empty -> forall s c= R :^: idx N, bounded_hl N s -> measure N (frontier N s) = measure N (closure N s) + - measure N (interior N s).
Admitted.

